01:12:30.650 --> 01:12:33.390
You heard of Mr. Cormelio, the examining magistrate?

01:12:34.230 --> 01:12:37.290
A man who can make himself very nasty when he wants to.

01:12:37.810 --> 01:12:40.930
And I'm in the doghouse already by having let Kirby kill himself.

01:12:41.070 --> 01:12:43.030
You see, I was more or less there at the time.

01:12:43.540 --> 01:12:45.420
In fact, he's fed up with the whole business.

01:12:45.540 --> 01:12:48.080
Another corpse, indeed, though, would be a hullabaloo.

01:12:49.060 --> 01:12:53.100
And I should be properly in the soup by having let Mrs. Kirby walk off like that

01:12:53.100 --> 01:12:55.300
without even finding out what she was carrying.

01:12:56.550 --> 01:12:58.690
As for you, how could you be implicated?

01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:02.160
We haven't been out in my sight the whole evening.

01:13:02.400 --> 01:13:07.490
And for the last week, spent a great deal of time together, haven't we?

01:13:08.110 --> 01:13:11.560
By the way, there's one thing I'd like to know.

01:13:12.520 --> 01:13:15.530
Am I following you or are you following me?

01:13:21.770 --> 01:13:23.860
You aren't squeamish, are you?

01:13:24.590 --> 01:13:25.910
I don't suppose it makes any difference.

01:13:30.160 --> 01:13:32.220
I don't suppose it makes any difference to you.

01:13:32.740 --> 01:13:34.920
A couple of women were knifed to death in the place.

01:13:35.060 --> 01:13:38.700
Who found that knife?

01:13:38.920 --> 01:13:42.600
I was supposed to have thrown it in the river as he went away.

01:13:43.010 --> 01:13:45.610
But you know, I'm not so sure.

01:13:46.290 --> 01:13:50.190
In fact, I've come to the conclusion that it might, after all, have been hidden here.

01:13:50.740 --> 01:13:52.960
What was Mrs. Kirby carrying just now?

01:13:53.300 --> 01:13:54.360
You see what I'm getting at?

01:13:55.170 --> 01:13:56.630
Something about a foot long.

01:13:56.790 --> 01:13:59.270
Wouldn't that be just about the size of a good dagger?

01:14:01.280 --> 01:14:02.960
You're quite right, Rennick. You're quite right.

01:14:03.140 --> 01:14:07.920
This case is getting more and more complicated all the time.

01:14:09.790 --> 01:14:10.430
What's this?

01:14:11.440 --> 01:14:13.300
You better follow.

01:14:14.170 --> 01:14:16.510
I didn't even find out when Kirby came.

01:14:23.850 --> 01:14:24.830
Must be getting daylight.

01:14:28.270 --> 01:14:28.550
Cheers.

01:14:29.110 --> 01:14:29.770
Those steps.

01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:31.460
We seem to be leading to that process.

01:14:32.010 --> 01:14:32.490
Wait a minute.

01:14:38.240 --> 01:14:39.340
We'd better be careful.

01:14:39.730 --> 01:14:42.690
Never mind, we've got to face facts sooner or later.

01:14:43.570 --> 01:14:44.690
You'd better open it.

01:14:47.420 --> 01:14:47.800
And then, sir.

01:15:11.540 --> 01:15:14.630
Yeah. He said he'd help me make some money for Gisela.

01:15:14.870 --> 01:15:15.410
And he...

01:15:15.410 --> 01:15:16.910
You swear to that in court.

01:15:17.090 --> 01:15:17.310
Yeah.

01:15:18.460 --> 01:15:19.380
You murdered him.

01:15:19.810 --> 01:15:21.390
He wanted me to die for what you've done.

01:15:24.520 --> 01:15:25.520
It's no good to us dead.

01:15:26.790 --> 01:15:28.510
Bring him into court, safe and sound.

01:15:28.650 --> 01:15:29.790
I don't want to lose my job.

01:15:30.030 --> 01:15:31.130
He wants to save your neck.

01:15:33.750 --> 01:15:35.990
Lucas, take this young lady home.

01:15:39.190 --> 01:15:41.170
Thank you for your cooperation, Miss Warren.

01:15:41.290 --> 01:15:42.490
You know who this man is.

01:15:43.440 --> 01:15:44.920
He wrote me and told me to come here.

01:15:45.060 --> 01:15:45.660
Was he the one?

01:15:46.080 --> 01:15:48.300
Yes, he wrote to both you and Mrs. Kirby,

01:15:48.360 --> 01:15:50.040
telling you first to go to the Bellevue.

01:15:51.110 --> 01:15:52.510
Then both of you to come here.

01:15:54.000 --> 01:15:55.520
He thought you might harm each other.

01:15:57.000 --> 01:15:59.740
I forgot one simple thing the police might intercept his mail.

01:16:00.600 --> 01:16:02.040
Uh, Mr. Camillio.

01:16:02.160 --> 01:16:04.270
Can we go now?

01:16:04.510 --> 01:16:06.170
Oh, yes, thank you, Miss Barney.

01:16:06.210 --> 01:16:07.740
You played your part well.

01:16:08.590 --> 01:16:09.450
Oh, Camillio, may I?

01:16:09.750 --> 01:16:11.300
I've got hair to iron.

01:16:12.770 --> 01:16:14.840
No, we can prove...

01:16:15.060 --> 01:16:18.530
Well, I've got the murderer, too.

01:16:18.730 --> 01:16:21.110
His name's Radek, R-E-D-E-K.

01:16:21.250 --> 01:16:21.870
He's a Czech.

01:16:22.570 --> 01:16:23.810
We're bringing him in.

01:16:24.940 --> 01:16:28.510
No, we can prove everything in court.

01:24:30.092 --> 01:24:30.332
Yeah.

01:26:14.560 --> 01:26:19.060
Thank you.
